                <note rend="inline" type="source">817.00/5138: Telegram</note>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">The Chargé in Nicaragua</hi> (<hi rendition="#italic">Munro</hi>) <hi rendition="#italic"
                        >to the Secretary of State</hi></head>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Managua</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1927-11-14T10:00:00-05:45"><hi rendition="#italic">November 14,
                                1927—10 a.m.</hi></date><lb/>[Received 1:15
                    p.m.]</dateline></opener>
                <p>332. Estrada was appointed <hi rendition="#italic">jefe politico</hi> of
                    Bluefields on November 12th.</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Munro</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
